<title>FRANCE: Soc Gen, C. Lyonnais cut rates.</title>
<headline>Soc Gen, C. Lyonnais cut rates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Societe Generale said on Friday it was cutting its bank base rate to 6.55 percent from 6.75, effective from Monday.</p>
<p>State-owned Credit Lyonnais also said it was reducing its base rate by the same amount to 6.55 percent, effective from Monday.</p>
</text>
